TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution hydrothermal solution
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 0.5
    Mn 1
KINETICS 1
Calcite
    -m0 1
    -m 1
    -parms 10.0 0.001
    -steps 1000 in 100
    -tol 1e-12
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -simulation true
    -state true
    -solution true
    -distance true
    -time true
    -step true
    -pH true
    -pe true
    -si Aragonite Calcite Rhodochrosite
END
